<title>USA: Atlanta Fed index 10.3 in March vs rvsd 7.1 in Feb.</title>
<headline>Atlanta Fed index 10.3 in March vs rvsd 7.1 in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said its index of industry business activity rose to 10.3 in March from a revised 7.1 in January.</p>
<p>					   March		  February</p>
<p>Industry Business Index	    10.3			7.1</p>
<p>Production Index			8.8			6.9</p>
<p>Prices Received			 2.9			0.9</p>
<p>Prices Paid			    15.2		     17.7</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		   -13.2		    -11.3</p>
<p>New Orders			    - 0.8		     14.3</p>
<p>Shipments			     - 0.9		     14.5</p>
<p>Number of Employees		   2.8		    - 0.8</p>
<p>Inventories of Finished Goods   - 1.0		    - 1.2</p>
<p>Materials Inventories	     -10.7		    - 4.7</p>
<p>Supplier Delivery Time		4.1			1.0</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
